      </div>
      <div class="jp-Cell jp-MarkdownCell jp-Notebook-cell">
        <div class="jp-Cell-inputWrapper" tabindex="0">
          <div class="jp-Collapser jp-InputCollapser jp-Cell-inputCollapser"></div>
          <div class="jp-InputArea jp-Cell-inputArea">
            <div class="jp-RenderedHTMLCommon jp-RenderedMarkdown jp-MarkdownOutput" data-mime-type="text/markdown">
              <p>С помощью dbscan не удалось четкого разделения на кластеры, попробуем kmean.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="jp-Cell jp-CodeCell jp-Notebook-cell">
        <div class="jp-Cell-inputWrapper" tabindex="0">
          <div class="jp-Collapser jp-InputCollapser jp-Cell-inputCollapser"></div>
          <div class="jp-InputArea jp-Cell-inputArea">
            <div class="jp-CodeMirrorEditor jp-Editor jp-InputArea-editor" data-type="inline">
              <div class="cm-editor cm-s-jupyter">
                <div class="highlight hl-ipython3">
                  <pre><span class="c1"># Функция метода локтя (elbow method)</span>
<span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">elbow_method</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">df</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">column_names</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="c1"># Предварительная обработка данных:</span>
    <span class="c1"># 1. Выделяем только интересующие колонки</span>
    <span class="n">df_subset</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">df</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">column_names</span><span class="p">]</span>
    
    <span class="c1"># 2. Удаляем строки с пропусками (NaN) по указанным колонкам</span>
    <span class="n">df_cleaned</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">df_subset</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">dropna</span><span class="p">()</span>
    
    <span class="c1"># 3. Нормализация данных</span>
    <span class="n">scaler</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">StandardScaler</span><span class="p">()</span>
    <span class="n">normalized_data</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">scaler</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">fit_transform</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">df_cleaned</span><span class="p">)</span>
    
    <span class="c1"># Список искажений (distortions)</span>
    <span class="n">distortions</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="p">[]</span>
    
    <span class="c1"># Проходим циклом по различным числам кластеров</span>
    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nb">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">15</span><span class="p">):</span>
        <span class="n">kmodel</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">KMeans</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">n_clusters</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">,</span>
                       <span class="n">n_init</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">1000</span><span class="p">,</span>  <span class="c1"># запускаем алгоритм 1000 раз с разными начальными центроидами</span>
                       <span class="n">random_state</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">)</span>
        
        <span class="c1"># Тренируем модель ТОЛЬКО НА НОРМАЛИЗОВАННЫХ ДАННЫХ ИЗ ВЫБРАННЫХ КОЛОНОК</span>
        <span class="n">kmodel</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">fit</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">normalized_data</span><span class="p">)</span>
        
        <span class="c1"># Собираем инерцию (суммарную квадратичную ошибку)</span>
        <span class="n">distortions</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">append</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">kmodel</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">inertia_</span><span class="p">)</span>
    
    <span class="c1"># Строим график</span>
    <span class="n">plt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">figure</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">figsize</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">10</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">6</span><span class="p">))</span>
    <span class="n">plt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">plot</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="nb">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">15</span><span class="p">),</span> <span class="n">distortions</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">marker</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s1">'o'</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="n">plt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">xlabel</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s1">'Количество кластеров'</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="n">plt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">ylabel</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s1">'Искажение (Sum of Squared Errors)'</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="n">plt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">title</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s1">'Метод локтя для определения оптимального числа кластеров'</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="n">plt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">grid</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kc">True</span><span class="p">)</span>
    <span class="n">plt</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">show</span><span class="p">()</span>

<span class="c1"># Пример вызова функции</span>
<span class="n">elbow_method</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">customers_ext</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="p">[</span><span class="s1">'delivery_delay_days'</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s1">'freight'</span><span class="p">])</span>
</pre>
